---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const EFFECTIVE_DATE = "September 15, 2026";
const CONTACT_EMAIL = "hello@digitaldramaa.com";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — DigitalDramaa"
  description="The terms that govern your use of DigitalDramaa's site and content."
  keywords={["DigitalDramaa", "terms and conditions", "terms of service", "digitaldramaa terms"]}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p>Effective {EFFECTIVE_DATE}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <p>
      These Terms & Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of digitaldramaa.com
      (the "Site"). By using the Site, you agree to these Terms. If you don't
      agree, please don't use the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>Description of Service</h2>
    <p>
      DigitalDramaa publishes AI-generated summaries and commentary on internet
      drama, gaming drama, and tech news that has already been reported
      elsewhere. Content is refreshed automatically throughout the day. The
      "Our take" section attached to each article is live, developing
      commentary — a take on where a story stands when it's published, not a
      final or concluded verdict. We are not the original source of the
      underlying news, and every article links back to that original
      reporting.
    </p>

    <h2>Content Accuracy & Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Content on the Site is generated and rewritten with AI assistance based
      on third-party reporting, and is provided "as is" without warranties of
      any kind, express or implied, including accuracy or completeness.
      Disputed or unconfirmed claims about real people are reported as
      alleged, not stated as fact. If you believe something on the Site is
      inaccurate, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> so we can review it.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      Underlying news facts and any material quoted or linked from third-party
      sources remain the property of their respective owners. DigitalDramaa's
      original commentary, site design, and branding are owned by
      DigitalDramaa. You may share links to our articles, but may not
      republish, scrape, or redistribute our content in bulk without
      permission.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to Third-Party Sites</h2>
    <p>
      The Site links out to the original reporting behind every story. We
      don't control and aren't responsible for the content, accuracy, or
      practices of those third-party sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p>
      You agree not to use the Site to attempt unauthorized access to our
      systems, interfere with normal operation of the Site (including through
      automated scraping at scale), or use the Site for any unlawful purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, DigitalDramaa and its operators
      are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages
      arising from your use of the Site or reliance on its content.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site
      after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      Material changes will be reflected by updating the effective date above.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these Terms can be sent to{" "}
      <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> or via our
      <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding: var(--sp-32) 0 var(--sp-24);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-32);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--note);
    background: var(--note-wash);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .page-head h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
  }

  .page-head p {
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 72ch;
    padding-bottom: var(--sp-64);
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: var(--sp-32) 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .prose h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: var(--sp-24);
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
